<title>CHINA: China's Nov retail price inflation 4.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China's Nov retail price inflation 4.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's retail price inflation rose 4.6 percent year-on-year in November, the China Securities newspaper said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Retail price inflation was 4.7 percent in October.</p>
</text>
